{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Immerse yourself in <strong>over an hour of original music</strong> by <strong>award-winning composer</strong> and music producer <strong>Martin Bezjak</strong>, created to accompany the wonderfully heartfelt journey of Elroy and Peggie across time and space. \ud83c\udfb8</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This <strong>38-track</strong> score blends lush orchestral ambiences, dark Americana textures, emotionally charged melodies, and heart-pounding cinematic climaxes.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">From subtle moments to grand storytelling peaks, the soundtrack captures the full emotional arc of the game. \u2764\ufe0f</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Also featured are two original songs co-written by <strong>Tadej Gregorcic</strong>:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfb5 &quot;Crimson Sky&quot; feat. <strong>Malidah</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfb5 &quot;Desert Man&quot; feat. <strong>\u017dan Videc</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With special guest <strong>Luka \u0160uli\u0107</strong> on cello.\u00a0\ud83c\udfbb</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u>Carefully mastered for premium listening in both <strong>MP3</strong> and <strong>24-bit FLAC</strong> formats.</u>\u00a0 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3786780/extras/Soundtrack_Loop-Steam.gif?t=1750948452\" /></div></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3786780?t=1750948452","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3786780/bab524311a945b52fc40cbaae516605c74e4257b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1750948452","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3786780/e272d4180ec25412b3f5a6c2ed4c552c5561904e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750948452","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3786780/e272d4180ec25412b3f5a6c2ed4c552c5561904e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1750948452","categories":[{"description":"Additional High-Quality Audio","id":50}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Immerse yourself in <strong>over an hour of original music</strong> by <strong>award-winning composer</strong> and music producer <strong>Martin Bezjak</strong>, created to accompany the wonderfully heartfelt journey of Elroy and Peggie across time and space. \ud83c\udfb8</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This <strong>38-track</strong> score blends lush orchestral ambiences, dark Americana textures, emotionally charged melodies, and heart-pounding cinematic climaxes.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">From subtle moments to grand storytelling peaks, the soundtrack captures the full emotional arc of the game. \u2764\ufe0f</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Also featured are two original songs co-written by <strong>Tadej Gregorcic</strong>:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfb5 &quot;Crimson Sky&quot; feat. <strong>Malidah</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfb5 &quot;Desert Man&quot; feat. <strong>\u017dan Videc</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With special guest <strong>Luka \u0160uli\u0107</strong> on cello.\u00a0\ud83c\udfbb</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u>Carefully mastered for premium listening in both <strong>MP3</strong> and <strong>24-bit FLAC</strong> formats.</u>\u00a0 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3786780/extras/Soundtrack_Loop-Steam.gif?t=1750948452\" /></div></p>","developers":["Motiviti"],"fullgame":{"appid":"1082190","name":"Elroy and the Aliens"},"head